jobs.description:
As an all-round production worker, you will work across different areas of production. You will learn the entire process and gradually gain more independence and responsibility as your experience and skills develop.

What will you be doing?:

- Operating, setting up and monitoring various production machines;
- Preparing fillings according to set recipes;
- Making and processing different types of dough;
- Baking and frying products;
- Checking quality throughout the production process;
- Preparing and weighing ingredients;
- Identifying minor irregularities or machine faults;
- Helping in the packaging department when needed;
- Cleaning machines, tools and work areas;
- Following all applicable hygiene and safety procedures.

This varied role is ideal for someone who enjoys hands-on work and is comfortable taking responsibility. Alongside your daily tasks, you will develop a thorough understanding of the recipes, machines and production processes. Together with your colleagues, you will ensure that every order is completed on time and meets the required quality standards.

Who are we looking for?

- You preferably have experience in food production, a bakery, a kitchen or a similar production environment;
- You have technical aptitude and can learn to operate production machines;
- You can follow recipes and work instructions independently;
- You work accurately, hygienically and with a focus on quality;
- You are flexible and willing to help your colleagues when needed;
- You enjoy carrying out a variety of tasks;
- You can work at a good pace while maintaining quality;
- You speak and understand Dutch and/or have a good command of English;
- Knowledge of HACCP is a plus, but can also be gained on the job.
